00:40:16.330 --> 00:40:27.310
<v Ben Tyrer>It's a very difficult dichotomy to work through, because I do want to help people, but I'm also afraid of them. I'm still trying to figure it out. I'm still trying to marry those two things together.
<v Ben Tyrer>这是一个非常困难的二分法，因为我确实想帮助人，但我又害怕他们。我仍在试图搞清楚。我仍在试图将这两件事结合在一起。

00:40:27.310 --> 00:40:39.110
<v Brian Reed>Well, you're doing exactly what nations are trying to figure out now, too. How to stay safe and not be afraid, but also help people. Like, that's what Germany seems to be going through, right, Damien?
<v Brian Reed>嗯，你做的正是国家现在也正在试图搞清楚的事情。如何保持安全而不害怕，同时也能帮助别人。比如，这就是德国似乎正在经历的事情，对吧，达米安？

