<v Zoe Chace>The early reporting described the boys as undocumented immigrants. And as the days went on, that became the focus of a lot of the coverage-- the boys' immigration status.
<v Zoe Chace>早期的报道描述这些男孩是无证移民。随着时间的推移，这成了很多报道的焦点——男孩们的移民身份。

