00:45:23.960 --> 00:45:36.770
<v Male Caller To Voicemail>Read the constitution. They are illegals. They should not be in the school system, period. Get it through your heads. They are illegals. Thank you very much.
<v Male Caller To Voicemail>读读宪法。他们是非法的。他们不应该进入学校系统，句号。动动你们的脑子。他们是非法的。非常感谢。

