00:46:30.200 --> 00:46:51.250
<v Jack Smith>What comes down here is that we serve every student that walks in our door. We are a public school system, and we serve all of our students when they come to us. And when we look at that, it is not only the right thing to do, and the good thing to do, and it benefits the students and our community-- it's also the law of the land. And it's what--
<v Jack Smith>归根结底是我们服务每一个走进我们大门的每个学生。我们是一个公立学校系统，当他们来找我们时，我们服务于我们所有的学生。当我们审视这一点时，这不仅是正确的事情，是好的事情，并且对学生和我们的社区有益——这还是国家的法律。这就是——

