00:47:46.250 --> 00:47:57.270
<v Tucker Carlson>In other words, diversity is our strength, move along, you're racist, shut up. Thanks, Jack. Why are people embarrassed to point to something that actually happened and draw obvious conclusions from it?
<v Tucker Carlson>换句话说，多样性是我们的力量，继续前进吧，你是种族主义者，闭嘴。谢谢，杰克。为什么人们对于指出实际发生的事情并得出明显的结论感到尴尬？

